  "details": "Hello I am using Unity 2019.4.31f1 with SDK3 worlds (VRCSDK3-WORLD-2021.11.24.16.19_Public.unitypackage) \nI have only gotten this to work once. Except now the VR chat control panel won't even be selectable on the unity menu. \nI have even followed the instructions here at: https://help.vrchat.com/hc/en-us/articles/360062658873-I-m-missing-menu-options-in-the-VRCSDK-menu\nI first used the world based instructions ...then when that files I also used the avatar instructions too. Neither improved the situation and I get about 33 errors on load. I have my %UserProfile%\\AppData\\Local\\Unity\\Editor file except i don't see how I can even attach that to your tickets...Also if you try to go to  http://bit.ly/vrchat-bug-reports, it takes you no where. \nAnyways I hope someone from VRC can help! Thank you!",
